note.p:
Source: Department of State, Central Files, 747C.00/10–2556. Top Secret;
                    Priority; Limit Distribution. Repeated to Paris, Athens, Ankara, and
                    Nicosia.

Telegram 2281, October 25, transmitted the text of the British rejection of the
                    Greek proposals, which noted that the proposals did not “form a realistic basis
                    for a settlement.”(Ibid.)
